wm-darwin: the READY deadline of a managed application (25 s) and the autopilot's wait for a
focused window (15 s) can be set from the environment, CHONKSTEP_DARWIN_APP_READY_SECONDS and
CHONKSTEP_DARWIN_AUTOPILOT_ARM_SECONDS (5..=600). The defaults are unchanged; the QEMU run of
the release root (release/image/qemu/prepare-run.sh) sets them longer, because under TCG on a
busy host the terminal took 27 s to start.

